   "install": {
    "title": "Install Now",
    "html": "<p>✅It takes <strong>only 8 minutes</strong> from installation to <strong>successful email sending</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">cd /opt &amp;&amp; git clone https://github.com/aaPanel/BillionMail &amp;&amp; cd BillionMail &amp;&amp; bash install.sh\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>Install with Docker:</strong> (Please install Docker and docker-compose-plugin manually, and modify .env file)</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">cd /opt &amp;&amp; git clone https://github.com/aaPanel/BillionMail &amp;&amp; cd BillionMail &amp;&amp; cp env_init .env &amp;&amp; docker compose up -d || docker-compose up -d\n</code></pre>",
